# The eight-bit shift produces 0xB0. All slices below are in bounds.
# Offset zero selects only zero-filled bits.
packet 0 AB 00 FF
expect 0 AB 00 00

# Offsets below four select both zero-filled bits and data.
packet 0 AB 01 FF
expect 0 AB 01 08
packet 0 AB 02 FF
expect 0 AB 02 0C
packet 0 AB 03 FF
expect 0 AB 03 06

# Offset four selects only data from the original value.
packet 0 AB 04 FF
expect 0 AB 04 0B
